# Additional analysis to run after production if desired
# Requires a restart/data snapshot and trajectory.
# RDF examples can be run in the main input by uncommenting.

# Phenothiazine N (type 5) vs Pb (type 2)
compute rdf_NPb all rdf 200 5 2
fix rdfout all ave/time 100 10 1000 c_rdf_NPb[*] file rdf_NPb.dat mode vector

# Phenothiazine S (type 6) vs Pb (type 2)
compute rdf_SPb all rdf 200 6 2
fix rdfout2 all ave/time 100 10 1000 c_rdf_SPb[*] file rdf_SPb.dat mode vector
